WEBVTT

00:00.974 --> 00:03.871
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:03.940 --> 00:11.043
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:12.871 --> 00:15.492
Ah, what a beautiful morning.
啊，多么美丽的早晨啊。

00:15.561 --> 00:17.009
Time to check the mail
是时候检查一下邮件了

00:17.078 --> 00:20.664
and see who loves you, Squidward.
看看谁爱你，章鱼哥。

00:20.733 --> 00:21.802
[sighs]
[叹气]

00:21.871 --> 00:25.595
I wonder if I can return
to sender.
我想知道我是否可以回来
至发件人。

00:25.664 --> 00:26.837
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

00:26.905 --> 00:30.802
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:30.871 --> 00:33.905
both: Good morning, Squidward.
两人：早上好，章鱼哥。

00:33.974 --> 00:37.043
Well, I'm going back to bed now.
好吧，我现在要回去睡觉了。

00:37.112 --> 00:39.112
Forever.
永远。

00:39.181 --> 00:40.319
Gah!
嘎！

00:40.388 --> 00:42.147
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

00:42.216 --> 00:44.561
Aren't you gonna open your mail?
你不打开你的邮件吗？

00:44.630 --> 00:45.630
Gimme that!
给我那个！

00:45.699 --> 00:48.078
It looks like you already did.
看来你已经这么做了。

00:48.147 --> 00:49.319
Hmm. <i>
[celebratory fanfare]</i>
唔。 <我>
[庆祝乐曲]</i>

00:49.388 --> 00:51.250
I won something?
我赢了什么？

00:51.319 --> 00:54.285
But I didn't enter any contest.
但我没有参加任何比赛。

00:54.354 --> 00:56.630
It's an all-expenses-paid trip
这是一次全程自费的旅行

00:56.699 --> 01:00.078
to see beautiful
Bora Bora Bottom.
看到美丽的
波拉波拉岛底部。

01:00.147 --> 01:03.630
We entered it for you,
and only 6,000 times too.
我们为您输入了，
而且也只有6000次。

01:03.699 --> 01:05.871
Wow.
哇。

01:05.940 --> 01:07.802
Me, a winner,
我，一个胜利者，

01:07.871 --> 01:10.974
at a tropical resort.
在一个热带度假胜地。

01:11.043 --> 01:13.802
Let's see,
"The winning family will board
让我们看看，
“获胜的家庭将登机

01:13.871 --> 01:16.388
at Bikini Bottom Airport
and the"...
在 比基尼堡机场
还有“...

01:16.457 --> 01:18.595
Wait a minute. <i>
[shattering]</i>
等一下。 <我>
[破碎]</i>

01:18.664 --> 01:20.250
"Winning family"?
“胜利家族”？

01:20.319 --> 01:24.457
Oh, did we forget to mention...
哦，我们是不是忘了说……

01:24.526 --> 01:25.526
<i>[licking]</i>
<i>[舔]</i>

01:25.561 --> 01:28.561
Oh, no.
哦，不。

01:28.630 --> 01:29.871
I cannot believe
我不敢相信

01:29.940 --> 01:32.388
I let you bottom-feeders
talk me into this.
我让你们底层喂食
说服我做这件事。

01:32.457 --> 01:36.561
Oh, it's the least we could
do for a friend like you.
哦，这是我们至少可以做的
为像你这样的朋友做。

01:36.630 --> 01:39.319
I mean, for a dad like you.
我的意思是，对于像你这样的父亲。

01:39.388 --> 01:40.388
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

01:40.457 --> 01:41.699
both: Daddy!
两人：爸爸！

01:41.768 --> 01:44.492
Will you morons... I mean,
children, please!
你们这些白痴会吗...我的意思是，
孩子们，拜托了！

01:44.561 --> 01:46.216
Next.
下一个。

01:46.285 --> 01:48.285
Ha.
哈。

01:48.354 --> 01:52.043
[gasps]
Attention, passengers.
[喘气]
乘客们请注意。

01:52.112 --> 01:56.526
Meet Underwater Air's
big contest winner,
认识水下空气
大赛优胜者，

01:56.595 --> 02:01.009
Squidward Tentacles
and his adorable family.
章鱼哥触手
和他可爱的家人。

02:01.078 --> 02:03.112
Huh, huh.
[cheers and applause]
呵呵。
[欢呼和掌声]

02:03.181 --> 02:05.181
Huh?
- Come on, Dad.
啊？
- 来吧，爸爸。

02:05.250 --> 02:07.216
Let's get a picture
of you and the kids
我们来一张图片
你和孩子们的

02:07.285 --> 02:09.974
for our in-flight magazine.
我们的机上杂志。

02:10.043 --> 02:11.354
[groans]
[呻吟]

02:11.423 --> 02:13.250
[sobs]
[抽泣]

02:13.319 --> 02:18.285
Okay, everybody, say,
"I love my family."
好吧，大家来说说，
“我爱我的家人。”

02:18.354 --> 02:20.388
- I'd rather not.
- [wailing]
- 我宁愿不。
- [哀号]

02:20.457 --> 02:21.974
Say it!
说吧！

02:22.043 --> 02:23.768
both: I love my family.
两人：我爱我的家人。

02:23.837 --> 02:26.526
[shutter clicks]
- [squeals]
[快门声]
- [尖叫声]

02:26.595 --> 02:28.733
[sighs] Hmm.
[叹气] 嗯。

02:28.802 --> 02:31.457
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:31.526 --> 02:32.837
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:32.905 --> 02:34.354
- [growls]
- [straining]
- [咆哮]
- [紧张]

02:34.423 --> 02:36.423
I think you're in my seat, Pop.
我想你坐在我的座位上，爸爸。

02:36.492 --> 02:38.940
[straining, sighs]
[紧张，叹气]

02:39.009 --> 02:41.388
Ooh!
- And I'll take the aisle.
哦！
- 我会走过道。

02:41.457 --> 02:44.492
[laughs]
both: ♪ Daddy's in the middle ♪
[笑]
both: ♪ Daddy's in the middle ♪

02:44.561 --> 02:45.664
Oh, no.
哦，不。

02:45.733 --> 02:47.905
I am not suffering
a whole flight
我没有痛苦
整个飞行

02:47.974 --> 02:50.009
between you two barnacle brains.
在你们两个藤壶脑之间。

02:50.078 --> 02:53.733
At least give me the aisle.
至少给我留个过道吧。

02:53.802 --> 02:55.699
Excuse me, sir.
对不起，先生。

02:55.768 --> 02:58.112
Are you in your assigned seat?
您在指定的座位上吗？

02:58.181 --> 02:59.423
[knuckles cracking]
[指关节嘎吱作响]

02:59.492 --> 03:01.423
[gulps] Um...
[咽口水] 嗯...

03:01.492 --> 03:03.871
[laughs]
[笑]

03:03.940 --> 03:05.802
[growls]
[咆哮]

03:05.871 --> 03:09.078
Okay, everybody,
please fasten your seat belts
好吧，大家，
请系好安全带

03:09.147 --> 03:12.181
by adjusting
this easy-to-pull strap.
通过调整
这条易于拉动的带子。

03:13.354 --> 03:15.354
Make sure it's nice and tight.
确保它漂亮且紧密。

03:15.423 --> 03:16.285
Wahh!
哇！

03:16.354 --> 03:17.733
And keep your seat
并保持座位

03:17.802 --> 03:20.319
in the upright position.
处于直立位置。

03:20.388 --> 03:21.630
Or else.
否则。

03:21.699 --> 03:22.733
Okay.
好的。

03:22.802 --> 03:24.526
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

03:24.595 --> 03:26.699
[babbling]
[胡说]

03:26.768 --> 03:29.905
These look good.
这些看起来不错。

03:29.974 --> 03:31.043
[grunting]
Ooh!
[咕噜声]
哦！

03:31.112 --> 03:32.043
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:32.112 --> 03:35.388
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:35.457 --> 03:39.699
Hey, Patrick, wanna switch
so I can look out the window?
嘿，帕特里克，想换
这样我就可以看看窗外了？

03:39.768 --> 03:41.492
Okay.
Oh, but hurry.
好的。
哦，但是快点。

03:41.561 --> 03:42.699
[straining]
[紧张]

03:42.768 --> 03:44.388
[groaning]
[呻吟]

03:44.457 --> 03:45.733
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

03:45.802 --> 03:47.423
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:47.492 --> 03:48.871
[growls]
[咆哮]

03:48.940 --> 03:51.285
<i>Uh... attention all passengers,</i>
<i>呃...请注意所有乘客，</i>

03:51.354 --> 03:53.354
<i>this is, uh,
your captain speaking.</i>
<i>这是，呃，
你的队长正在讲话。</i>

03:53.423 --> 03:55.699
<i>Please keep your, uh,
seat belts fastened</i>
<i>请保留你的，呃，
系好安全带</i>

03:55.768 --> 03:58.147
<i>as we, uh, gain altitude.</i>
<i>当我们，呃，海拔升高时。</i>

03:58.216 --> 03:59.630
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

03:59.699 --> 04:00.561
- Whoa.
- [laughs]
- 哇哦。
- [笑]

04:00.630 --> 04:01.699
Whoa!
哇！

04:01.768 --> 04:05.492
[engine roaring]
[发动机轰鸣]

04:05.561 --> 04:06.388
[chime]
[铃声]

04:06.457 --> 04:08.319
<i>Enjoy your flight.</i>
<i>祝您飞行愉快。</i>

04:08.388 --> 04:11.078
<i>You may now roam
about the, uh, cabin.</i>
<i>您现在可以漫游了
关于，呃，小屋。</i>

04:11.147 --> 04:12.216
Hear that, Squidward?
听到了吗，章鱼哥？

04:12.285 --> 04:14.181
You can take your seat belt
off now.
你可以系好安全带
现在关闭。

04:14.250 --> 04:15.699
Wait!
Untie me!
等待！
给我解开！

04:15.768 --> 04:16.871
[both babbling]
[两人都胡言乱语]

04:16.940 --> 04:18.664
- Ow!
- [grunts] Oh!
- 噢！
- [咕哝]哦！

04:18.733 --> 04:21.699
Oh, boy, a feed bag!
哦，天哪，一个饲料袋！

04:21.768 --> 04:22.871
[inhales]
[吸气]

04:22.940 --> 04:25.457
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:25.526 --> 04:26.940
[air hissing]
- Ow!
[空气嘶嘶声]
- 噢！

04:27.009 --> 04:28.595
Hey!
[passengers groaning]
嘿！
[乘客呻吟声]

04:31.354 --> 04:34.216
- [grumbling]
- [snoring]
- [抱怨]
- [打鼾]

04:34.285 --> 04:37.112
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

04:37.181 --> 04:38.802
Keep it down, will ya?
保持低调，好吗？

04:38.871 --> 04:40.768
I'm tryin' to sleep!
我正想睡觉呢！

04:40.837 --> 04:41.837
Ahh!
啊！

04:41.905 --> 04:43.457
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:43.526 --> 04:46.974
Ugh,
I dreamed I was in the ocean,
呃，
我梦见自己在大海里

04:47.043 --> 04:48.768
and now I gotta pee!
现在我要尿尿！

04:48.837 --> 04:50.330
Ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh,
ooh, ooh, ooh, ooh.
哦哦哦哦哦
哦，哦，哦，哦。

04:50.354 --> 04:51.285
Huh?
啊？

04:51.354 --> 04:53.733
Uh, huh?
呃，嗯？

04:53.802 --> 04:55.009
Uh... ah!
- Can I help you
呃……啊！
- 我可以帮你吗

04:55.078 --> 04:56.147
with something?
与某事？

04:56.216 --> 04:58.595
Yeah, I gotta use a bathroom!
是啊，我要上厕所！

04:58.664 --> 05:00.802
[grunts]
- Ahh!
[咕哝]
- 啊！

05:00.871 --> 05:03.354
Rude.
I was here first.
粗鲁的。
我先来的。

05:03.423 --> 05:05.802
Wah!
哇！

05:05.871 --> 05:06.905
Oh!
哦！

05:06.974 --> 05:08.699
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:08.768 --> 05:12.285
Hey, buddy, what happened
to the other flight attendant?
嘿，伙计，发生了什么事
给另一位空姐？

05:12.354 --> 05:14.009
She's in the bathroom.
她在浴室里。

05:14.078 --> 05:15.112
- Ahh!
- See?
- 啊！
- 看？

05:15.181 --> 05:17.630
Whoa!
哇！

05:17.699 --> 05:18.871
Ooh.
哦。

05:18.940 --> 05:21.009
Ahh!
啊！

05:21.078 --> 05:22.768
Oh.
哦。

05:22.837 --> 05:24.147
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:24.216 --> 05:25.871
[straining]
[紧张]

05:25.940 --> 05:27.733
[growls] Huh?
[咆哮]啊？

05:27.802 --> 05:30.630
The flight attendants
will save me.
空乘人员
会救我的。

05:30.699 --> 05:32.216
[strains]
[菌株]

05:32.285 --> 05:35.768
Just need
to hit that call button.
只需要
点击呼叫按钮。

05:35.837 --> 05:36.768
[grunts]
[button chimes]
[咕哝]
[按钮铃声]

05:36.837 --> 05:38.319
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:38.388 --> 05:40.940
Good evening, Mr. Sir!
晚上好，先生！

05:41.009 --> 05:43.595
Fresh coffee?
新鲜咖啡？

05:43.664 --> 05:44.974
What?
什么？

05:45.043 --> 05:47.319
Patrick, where are the real
flight attendants?
帕特里克，真正的人在哪里？
空姐？

05:47.388 --> 05:49.940
They've been in the bathroom
for a while.
他们已经在浴室里了
有一段时间了。

05:50.009 --> 05:53.802
I think they had
too much coffee.
我认为他们有
咖啡太多了。

05:53.871 --> 05:56.423
Now how about that coffee?
现在那杯咖啡怎么样？

05:56.492 --> 05:58.492
No, I don't want... ahh!
不，我不想……啊！

05:58.561 --> 06:00.147
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

06:00.216 --> 06:03.837
Wow, Squidward,
you really like coffee!
哇，章鱼哥，
你真的很喜欢咖啡！

06:03.905 --> 06:05.457
Whoa!
哇！

06:05.526 --> 06:06.974
<i>[intercom chimes]
- Uh, folks.</i>
<i>[对讲机铃声]
- 呃，各位。</i>

06:07.043 --> 06:08.595
<i>Sorry about that turbulence.</i>
<i>对这次动荡感到抱歉。</i>

06:08.664 --> 06:09.733
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:09.802 --> 06:11.354
Wow, Patrick.
哇，帕特里克。

06:11.423 --> 06:14.112
They made you
a flight attendant?
他们让你
空姐？

06:14.181 --> 06:17.699
Yeah-huh.
Hey, you wanna be one too?
是啊哈。
嘿，你也想成为其中一员吗？

06:17.768 --> 06:19.354
[gasps] Yeah.
[喘气]是的。

06:19.423 --> 06:24.905
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:24.974 --> 06:26.216
Ah.
啊。

06:26.285 --> 06:27.802
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

06:27.871 --> 06:30.561
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

06:30.630 --> 06:33.388
[gasps]
Our apologies, sir.
[喘气]
我们很抱歉，先生。

06:33.457 --> 06:34.871
Let's get you dried off.
让我们把你擦干。

06:34.940 --> 06:36.078
[air whooshing]
[空气呼啸]

06:36.147 --> 06:37.940
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:38.009 --> 06:39.043
Whoa!
哇！

06:39.112 --> 06:40.595
[crash]
[碰撞]

06:40.664 --> 06:42.940
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:43.009 --> 06:44.147
[spluttering]
[溅射]

06:44.216 --> 06:46.561
Huh?
I'm free.
啊？
我有空了。

06:46.630 --> 06:48.595
I'm free!
我自由了！

06:48.664 --> 06:50.664
[gasps]
- Snack time!
[喘气]
- 零食时间！

06:50.733 --> 06:52.699
[babbling]
[胡说]

06:52.768 --> 06:53.699
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:53.768 --> 06:55.492
Whee!
哎哟！

06:55.561 --> 06:56.974
Oh, no.
哦，不。

06:57.043 --> 06:58.768
Whoa!
哇！

06:58.837 --> 07:02.112
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:02.181 --> 07:03.768
That's it!
就是这样！

07:03.837 --> 07:07.492
I am filing a complaint
with the captain.
我正在提出投诉
与船长。

07:07.561 --> 07:10.216
Roll me to the front
of the plane.
把我滚到前面
飞机的。

07:10.285 --> 07:12.009
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

07:12.078 --> 07:14.802
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

07:14.871 --> 07:18.147
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:18.216 --> 07:19.285
Huh?
啊？

07:19.354 --> 07:21.423
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

07:21.492 --> 07:24.181
Are you enjoying your flight?
您的飞行愉快吗？

07:24.250 --> 07:25.940
No, I am not.
不，我不是。

07:26.009 --> 07:28.871
These two have been nothing
but trouble since we took off.
这两个本来就没什么
但自从我们起飞以来就遇到了麻烦。

07:28.940 --> 07:32.768
And now they've replaced
the flight attendants.
现在他们已经取代了
空乘人员。

07:32.837 --> 07:35.699
Uh, what did they do with them?
呃，他们对它们做了什么？

07:35.768 --> 07:39.216
I just opened
the bathroom door, Captain.
我刚打开
浴室的门，船长。

07:39.285 --> 07:41.354
Like this.
像这样。

07:41.423 --> 07:43.699
Oh!
[both groaning]
哦！
[两人都呻吟]

07:43.768 --> 07:45.216
both: Ahh.
两人：啊。

07:45.285 --> 07:48.837
Ahh!
啊！

07:48.905 --> 07:50.319
Oh.
哦。

07:50.388 --> 07:54.699
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:54.768 --> 07:56.216
Huh?
啊？

07:56.285 --> 07:59.250
There's no one flying the plane!
飞机上没人啊！

07:59.319 --> 08:00.871
Ahh! <i>
[alarm bells blare]</i>
啊！ <我>
[警钟长鸣]</i>

08:00.940 --> 08:02.733
Ahh!
啊！

08:02.802 --> 08:03.802
[screams]
[尖叫声]

08:03.871 --> 08:06.319
What are we gonna do?
我们要做什么？

08:06.388 --> 08:08.285
Oh, we're gonna crash.
哦，我们要崩溃了。

08:08.354 --> 08:12.216
Uh, uh,
I guess I can figure this out.
呃，呃，
我想我能弄清楚这一点。

08:12.285 --> 08:15.354
Yeah, how hard could it be?
是啊，这能有多难呢？

08:15.423 --> 08:18.561
[panel beeping rapidly]
[面板快速发出蜂鸣声]

08:19.837 --> 08:25.009
Squidward, trust your instincts.
章鱼哥，相信你的直觉。

08:25.078 --> 08:27.768
I suppose, uh...
我想，呃...

08:27.837 --> 08:29.388
[beeps]
[嘟嘟声]

08:29.457 --> 08:31.388
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:31.457 --> 08:34.250
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

08:34.319 --> 08:36.457
Look, Squidward,
we're almost there!
看，章鱼哥，
我们快到了！

08:36.526 --> 08:38.181
Now all you gotta do
is land this thing!
现在你要做的就是
就是土地这个东西！

08:38.250 --> 08:40.423
And not kill everyone.
并且不杀掉所有人。

08:40.492 --> 08:43.423
both: Squidward,
Squidward, Squidward!
两者：章鱼哥，
章鱼哥，章鱼哥！

08:43.492 --> 08:45.354
[screaming]
[alarm beeping]
[尖叫]
[警报声]

08:45.423 --> 08:47.250
[all screaming]
- Squidward!
[所有人尖叫]
- 章鱼哥！

08:47.319 --> 08:51.181
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:51.250 --> 08:53.423
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:53.492 --> 08:58.388
both: Squidward, Squidward!
- [groaning]
两人：章鱼哥，章鱼哥！
- [呻吟]

08:58.457 --> 09:00.250
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:00.319 --> 09:03.285
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:03.354 --> 09:05.561
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:05.630 --> 09:08.181
Ahh!
啊！

09:08.250 --> 09:10.009
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

09:10.078 --> 09:11.871
Hmm?
唔？

09:11.940 --> 09:13.285
[both cheer]
[两人欢呼]

09:13.354 --> 09:15.457
Yay, Squidward!
耶，章鱼哥！

09:15.526 --> 09:18.940
Huh?
Bora Bora Bottom!
啊？
波拉波拉岛底部！

09:19.009 --> 09:21.802
Hmm.
唔。

09:21.871 --> 09:23.664
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

09:23.733 --> 09:25.664
Uh, attention, passengers,
呃，乘客们请注意，

09:25.733 --> 09:28.423
this is your new captain speaking.
这是你们的新队长在讲话。

09:28.492 --> 09:32.630
We have arrived
at beautiful Bora Bora Bottom.
我们已经到了
在美丽的波拉波拉岛底部。

09:32.699 --> 09:35.216
Ha... huh?
[engine whirring]
哈……啊？
[引擎的呼呼声]

09:35.285 --> 09:37.112
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:37.181 --> 09:38.250
Wait a minute!
等一下！

09:38.319 --> 09:40.319
I thought I stopped this thing!
我以为我阻止了这件事！

09:40.388 --> 09:42.871
[laughs]
Squidward, look!
[笑]
Squidward, look!

09:42.940 --> 09:46.354
It was on auto-pilot
the whole time.
它处于自动驾驶状态
一直以来。

09:46.423 --> 09:48.250
Yay, Squidward!
耶，章鱼哥！

09:48.319 --> 09:50.526
You did nothing!
你什么也没做！

09:50.595 --> 09:53.837
[both laugh]
- No, no!
[两人都笑了]
- 不，不！

09:53.905 --> 09:57.423
I need to get off this plane
and enjoy the resort!
我需要下飞机
并享受度假村！

09:57.492 --> 09:59.699
Now why would you wanna do that?
现在你为什么要这么做？

09:59.768 --> 10:00.871
[laughs]
[笑]

10:00.940 --> 10:03.388
You won a trip
to see Bora Bora Bottom,
你赢得了一次旅行
去看波拉波拉岛底部，

10:03.457 --> 10:05.388
not stay there, silly.
不要呆在那里，傻瓜。

10:05.457 --> 10:07.905
And there it goes.
就这样。

10:07.974 --> 10:08.974
Huh?
啊？

10:09.009 --> 10:11.837
[sighs]
Life is funny, isn't it?
[叹气]
生活很有趣，不是吗？

10:11.905 --> 10:13.630
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:13.699 --> 10:15.837
[chimes]
[编钟]

10:15.905 --> 10:16.905
Ahh!
啊！

10:16.974 --> 10:19.871
[screaming]
[尖叫]

10:19.940 --> 10:22.595
Ow!
噢！

10:22.664 --> 10:25.147
<i>This is your
flight attendant speaking.</i>
<i>这是你的
空乘人员讲话。</i>

10:25.216 --> 10:29.009
<i>Looks like we're experiencing
some headwinds,</i>
<i>看起来我们正在经历
一些逆风，</i>

10:29.078 --> 10:32.216
<i>and the present estimate
for our return flight</i>
<i>和目前的估计
回程航班</i>

10:32.285 --> 10:36.043
<i>to Bikini Bottom is 24 hours!</i>
<i>到 Bikini Bottom 需要 24 小时！</i>

10:36.112 --> 10:39.423
<i>[both laugh]</i>
<i>[都笑了]</i>

10:39.492 --> 10:43.009
No!
不！

不！